  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "The owners have already moved on, making this a genuine opportunity for a serious buyer ready to act.\r\n\r\nSet well back from the road on a generous 678sqm freehold section, this substantial four-bedroom, two-bathroom, two-living concrete home offers a rare combination of space, privacy and position — just a few minutes' walk down to Waiake Beach, the playground and the local café and lifestyle scene.\r\n\r\nThe layout offers genuine flexibility across two levels. Upstairs, open-plan living and dining centre around a cosy wood burner, flowing out to a private, elevated deck that looks over mature, established gardens — palms, ferns and magnolias create a real sense of retreat, with steps leading down to a large, private, north-facing lawn. The kitchen and two further bedrooms complete this level. Downstairs, a second living area, master bedroom with ensuite and walk-in robe, and a fourth bedroom offer scope for teenagers, extended family, or a home office setup — separate but connected.\r\n\r\nOutside, a double internal-access garage and an expansive concrete driveway/turning area provide ample parking for family and visitors alike, while the elevated deck and sprawling lawn create the outdoor lifestyle this pocket of Waiake is known for.\r\n\r\nThis is a home with good bones, in a position that's increasingly hard to find — private, spacious, and an easy stroll to everything Waiake and Torbay offer.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n• 678sqm freehold section, set well back from the road\r\n• 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, 2 living areas across two levels\r\n• Master bedroom with ensuite and walk-in robe\r\n• Wood burner, opening to a private elevated deck\r\n• Established gardens, large private lawn\r\n• Double internal-access garage plus extensive parking\r\n• Opportunity to add your own touches\r\n• Minutes' walk to Waiake Beach, playground and amenities\r\n• Close to Torbay Shops, Long Bay Regional Park and Browns Bay\r\n\r\nYour Waiake lifestyle starts here. Call today to view — vendors are ready to sell.",
